<title>UK: Abbey National unit set 150 bln lire four-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Abbey National unit set 150 bln lire four-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Credito Italiano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL</p>
<p> AMT    150 BLN LIRE  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    17.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE   CAPPED FRN    MARGIN    *+0.125    PAY DATE    17.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY **AA2     ISS PRICE  100.245   FULL FEES   40 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   **AA-     REOFFER    99.97</p>
<p> NOTES     *8.50 PCT CAP</p>
<p>	    **GUARANTOR</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR DEBT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
